Package: uoshim-wayland-im
Version: 1.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: bash, libc6 (>= 2.28), libwayland-client0, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0
Maintainer: Local Build <local@localhost>
Description: Standalone KWin Wayland input-method bridge for UOS fcitx/Sogou
 Provides native-Wayland Chinese input (Sogou via fcitx) by installing a
 wayland-im-shim client that KWin spawns through [Wayland] InputMethod.
 Decoupled from eglrun: does NOT depend on or modify eglrun files. Installs
 the CPIS uinput DBus policy via maintainer script so clean installs can
 drive Sogou/fcitx without touching dpkg's stale file-ownership record.
 Installed under /opt/uoshim-wayland-im; source included in src/ime.
